# Build context for deploy/sandbox/Dockerfile.
#
# With the default KIT_SOURCE=proxy nothing is COPYed from the context at all
# (BuildKit then skips transferring it entirely). With KIT_SOURCE=local the
# `kit-local` stage does `COPY . .`, so anything let through here becomes part
# of that stage's cache key — keep this list tight: every ignored path is one
# less reason to recompile kit.
.git
.github
.agents
.vscode
.idea

# Build outputs / local artifacts
output
dist
kit
*.log
*.test
*.out

# Docs, site and assets — not needed to compile ./cmd/kit
www
contribute
skills
npm
logo.jpg
LICENSE
README.md
AGENTS.md
**/node_modules

# Container/CI plumbing (changing the Dockerfile shouldn't bust the src layer)
deploy
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
